# Anima-Remap: remap cache files (save_remapped output). These are meant to
# live next to the user's own LoRA files outside this repo, but are ignored
# here in case one ever ends up in a working copy during testing.
*_animaremap*.safetensors
*_animaremap*.pt
*_animaremap*.ckpt
*_animaremap*.sft

# Composed manifests are meant to be committed (they're small JSON files and
# other users benefit from not having to run compose_manifests.py
# themselves), so they are intentionally NOT ignored here.
